#. 【話】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[talk]"
msgstr ""

#. 話っていうのは、
#. 腐川さんが、大神さんに呼び出された件だよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I wanted to talk about the fact that Sakura had asked\n"
"to meet with you."
msgstr ""

#. …なッ！！
msgctxt "0003 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh—!?"
msgstr ""

#. し、し、知らないわよ…
#. あ、あたしは…何も…知らないわよ…！
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I-I-I don't know what you're t-talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. …十神クンは、呼び出された件に関しては
#. 認めてたよ？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Byakuya already told me she had asked to meet with\n"
"him."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　白夜様もあいつに呼び出されてたの…？
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What...? She w-wanted to meet with Master, too?"
msgstr ""

#. ハッ！　<CLT 3>“白夜様も”<CLT>って言っちゃった…！
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ah! I just s-said \"<CLT 3>too<CLT>,\" didn't I...?"
msgstr ""

#. これじゃあ、あたしも呼び出されたって…
#. バレバレじゃない…！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I guess now it's t-totally obvious, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうだね…
#. じゃあ、話してくれるよね…？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-Yeah, pretty much... So, can you tell me about it?"
msgstr ""

#. た、確かに<CLT 3>メモは見た<CLT>わ…
msgctxt "0010 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I a-admit, I did <CLT 3>get the note<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…<CLT 3>会いに行ってない<CLT>わよ…
#. こ、怖くて…行けなかったのよ…！
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"B-But I didn't go <CLT 3>see her<CLT>! I was s-scared, so...I\n"
"couldn't bring m-myself to go!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、腐川さんは会いに行ってないって
#. 言ってるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Toko claims she didn't go see her, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…本当はどうなんだろう？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...can I really believe her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、その証言をひっくり返すような根拠がない以上、
#. 現時点では信じるしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, until I can prove otherwise, I have no choice\n"
"but to accept it as fact.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. も、もういいでしょ…
#. あたしは…部屋に戻るわよ…
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Is that g-good enough? Then I'm going back to m-my\n"
"room..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんは、そそくさと部屋の中に戻っていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With that, Toko quickly retreated into her room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>腐川の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Toko's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 【いやらしい話】
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[indecent]"
msgstr ""

#. あの…いやらしいってよく言うけど…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Um, you know...you're always talking about how\n"
"indecent things are."
msgstr ""

#. そういう事言い出すのって、
#. いつも腐川さんだよね…？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But you're always the one who brings it up in the\n"
"first place, ya know?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なぁ！？
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What!?"
msgstr ""

#. あああ、あんた…
#. 苗木の分際で…言葉責めでもしようって気！？
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You think y-you can beat me in a battle of wits?\n"
"*You*? You're n-nothing...!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そんなつもりは…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's not what I'm trying to do..."
msgstr ""

#. だだだ、駄目よ…！
#. あたしを責めていいのは白夜様だけ…！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"D-D-Don't bother! The only one who's allowed to\n"
"a-accuse me is Master!"
msgstr ""

#. ああ…あたしの身も心も…
#. 白夜様に…
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "My h-heart and soul belong to h-him...!"
msgstr ""

#. んはぁぁぁ～～～んッ！
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Aaaaahhh~!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうやって収めよう、この状況。<CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>I need to pump the brakes on this situation...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ハッ！
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Ah—!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>気まずい…<CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 4>Awkward silence...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 【用事】
msgctxt "0032 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[Need something]"
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと、確認したい事があるんだ。
#. 葉隠クンが大神さんに呼び出された件なんだけど…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, actually...I just wanted to check something.\n"
"It's about how Sakura wanted to meet with you..."
msgstr ""

#. な、な、なんで知ってんだ！？
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "H-H-How'd you know about that!?"
msgstr ""

#. は…！　さては俺の心を読んだな？
#. 特異な能力に目覚めたんだべな！？
msgctxt "0035 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Uwah! Did you maybe...gaze into my soul? Have your\n"
"special abilities awakened in you!?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、呼び出されたのは俺だけじゃねーべ！
msgctxt "0036 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "B-But! I'm not the only one she wanted to meet with!"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川っちと十神っちも呼び出したって、
#. 当の<CLT 3>オーガ自身が言ってた<CLT>べ！
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"<CLT 3>Ogre told me herself<CLT> that she asked Byakuya and Toko\n"
"to come, too!"
msgstr ""

#. え？　大神さん自身から聞いたの？
#. それって、いつ聞いたの？
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? When did Sakura tell you that?"
msgstr ""

#. あ…！　そ、それは…！
msgctxt "0039 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh—! W-Well...!"
msgstr ""

#. オーガに呼び出された時だべ！！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "When she asked me to meet with her, of course!"
msgstr ""

#. メモで呼び出されたんじゃないの…？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...didn't she write you a note?"
msgstr ""

#. そう…メモを…メモを…
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah, uh...a note...she uh..."
msgstr ""

#. …手渡しされたんだべ！！
#. そん時に、ついでに聞いたんだ！
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"She gave it to me in person! And she happened to\n"
"mention the others, like, in passing!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだか…あからさまに怪しいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I gotta be honest, this is super suspicious...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それで、大神さんに会いに行ったの？
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So then you went and met with Sakura?"
msgstr ""

#. い、行ってねーって！
#. 俺が…会いに行く訳ねーだろ！
msgctxt "0046 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No way, I totally didn't! Why would I ever do that!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…何か怪しいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yeah...definitely suspicious.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 俺が最後にオーガと会ったのは、
#. 怪我した朝日奈っちを保健室に連れてった時だべ！
msgctxt "0048 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The last time I saw Ogre was when Hina got hurt and I\n"
"took her to the nurse's office!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>それ以来、会ってねーって！！<CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 3>I haven't seen her<CLT> since then!"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに…受け取ったメモを見せてもらえる？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"While I'm here, could you show me the note she gave\n"
"you?"
msgstr ""

#. メモ…残ってたっけなぁ…？
#. えーっと…
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh, um...do I still have it...? Let's see..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンはポケットの中に手を突っ込むと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro was feeling around in his pockets...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あー、スマン！　ないわ、ないない！！
msgctxt "0053 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ah, sorry! Looks like I don't have it anymore!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ひきつったような笑みを見せながら、
#. ポケットの中から手を出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>With a big, goofy smile on his face, he pulled his\n"
"hands back out of his pockets.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と、その時、
#. 何かがボクの足元に落ちた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But when he did, I saw something flutter to the\n"
"ground...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの<CLT><CLT 3>“ポケットに入ってた何か”<CLT><CLT 4>が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something had <CLT><CLT 3>fallen out of Hiro's pocket<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ん…？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. あ…
msgctxt "0058 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ah..."
msgstr ""

#. ああーーッ！！
msgctxt "0059 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Aahhh—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは風のような速さで、
#. それを拾い上げると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Quick as the wind, Hiro snatched it back up again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>再び、ポケットの中へと突っ込んだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...and shoved it back into his pocket.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. てへへ。ゴミだべゴミ…
#. ゴミを捨て忘れてたべ…
msgctxt "0062 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Ehehe. Sorry, just a bit of trash I forgot to throw\n"
"out..."
msgstr ""

#. ゴミ…？
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Trash...?"
msgstr ""

#. と、とにかく！　俺はオーガに呼び出されたけど、
#. 実際には会いに行ってねーって事で…
msgctxt "0064 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"A-Anyway! I can't deny that Ogre asked to meet with\n"
"me, but I never went..."
msgstr ""

#. …失礼させてもらうべ！！
msgctxt "0065 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So, well, if you'll excuse me...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一方的に会話を打ち切ると、
#. 葉隠クンは部屋の中へと逃げていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before waiting for a reply, Hiro quickly slipped back\n"
"into his room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンはゴミだなんて言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro said that was just trash, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただのゴミなんかじゃないよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...there's no way that's all there was to it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ポケットに入っていたゴミ<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Pocket Trash<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…？　なんなの…？
#. <CLT 1>【話】<CLT>があるとか…言ってたわよね…
msgctxt "0070 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wh-What do you want? You said you wanted to <CLT 1>[talk]<CLT>\n"
"to m-me about something...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 1>【いやらしい話】<CLT>だったら…承知しないわよ…
#. すぐさまセクハラで訴えるからね…
msgctxt "0071 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If it's s-something <CLT 1>[indecent]<CLT>, get ready for a\n"
"sexual h-harassment lawsuit..."
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち…どうしたん？
#. 俺に、何か<CLT 1>【用事】<CLT>でもあるんか…？
msgctxt "0072 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What's up, Makoto? Did you <CLT 1>[need something]<CLT> from me?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは、ボクの部屋だけど…
#. 事件には関係ないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is my room. But it has nothing to do with the\n"
"case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは霧切さんの部屋だ。
#. 事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Kyoko's room. It has nothing to do with the\n"
"case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>インターホンを押した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I pressed the doorbell...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらくすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And after a few seconds...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…？　誰…？
msgctxt "0078 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? Wh-Who's there?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>負のオーラ…それにも増して…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Agh, the most negative aura I've ever felt...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐のオーラ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>An aura of total decay...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…？　なんなの…？
msgctxt "0081 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Well? What do y-you want?"
msgstr ""

#. 腐川さん…に戻ってたんだね。
#. ジェノサイダーじゃなくって…
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So you're back to normal. Genocide Jack isn't around\n"
"anymore..."
msgstr ""

#. あいつの話…しないでよ…
#. き、気分が悪くなるじゃない……
msgctxt "0083 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"D-Don't even say her name... It makes me s-sick to my\n"
"stomach..."
msgstr ""

#. せっかく…楽しい気分なのに…！
msgctxt "0084 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I was in such a g-good mood, too...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>楽しい気分には見えないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She didn't *look* like she was in a good mood...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あのさ、ちょっと話があるんだけど、
#. 今いいかな？
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hey, I was...hoping to talk to you about something. Is\n"
"now a bad time?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0087 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. チッ…！
msgctxt "0088 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kh...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>露骨な舌打ちの後、
#. 腐川さんは廊下に出て来てくれた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously annoyed, Toko slithered out into the hall.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…？　なんなの…？
#. <CLT 1>【話】<CLT>があるとか…言ってたわよね…
msgctxt "0090 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wh-What do you want? You said you wanted to <CLT 1>[talk]<CLT>\n"
"to m-me about something...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 1>【いやらしい話】<CLT>だったら…承知しないわよ…
#. すぐさまセクハラで訴えるからね…
msgctxt "0091 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If it's s-something <CLT 1>[indecent]<CLT>, get ready for a\n"
"sexual h-harassment lawsuit..."
msgstr ""

#. …これ以上、しつこく聞くのもな…
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I probably should avoid pestering people too much..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さん本人が言うには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko already told me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かにメモは見た。
#. でも、怖いから会いには行かなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She said she did get the note, but she was too scared\n"
"to go meet with Sakura.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…って事だったな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's what she claims, anyway.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …本当はどうなんだろう？
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But what's the truth of the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、その証言をひっくり返すような根拠がない以上、
#. 現時点では信じるしかないか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, until I can prove otherwise, I have no choice\n"
"but to accept it as fact.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここは朝日奈さんの部屋だ。
#. 事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Hina's room. It has nothing to do with the\n"
"case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの部屋だ。
#. 事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Byakuya's room. It has nothing to do with the\n"
"case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんの部屋だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is Sakura's room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ……………
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>インターホンを押した…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I pressed the doorbell...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ピンポーン…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しばらくすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0104 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And after a few seconds...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っち…どうしたん？
#. 俺に、何か<CLT 1>【用事】<CLT>でもあるんか…？
msgctxt "0105 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What's up, Makoto? Did you <CLT 1>[need something]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. これ以上、しつこく聞くのもな…
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I probably should avoid pestering people too much..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クン本人が言うには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro already told me...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモを手渡しされて、呼び出された。
#. でも会いには行かなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He said Sakura handed the note to him personally, but\n"
"he never went to go meet with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、葉隠クンが最後に大神さんと会ったのは、
#. 怪我した朝日奈さんを保健室に連れてった時…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But he also said the last time he saw Sakura was when\n"
"he took Hina to the nurse's office...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その時点で話が矛盾している。
#. メモを渡されたのは保健室の一件の後のはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So he contradicted himself. If she gave him the note\n"
"in person, *that* would've been the last time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何か隠しているみたいだ。
#. あからさまに怪しい…
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He's acting really suspicious. I think he must be\n"
"hiding something..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Plus...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの<CLT><CLT 3>ポケットに入ってた何か<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. 葉隠クンはゴミだなんて言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was <CLT><CLT 3>whatever fell out of his pocket<CLT><CLT 4>. He said\n"
"it was a piece of trash, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただのゴミなんかじゃない…よな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I think there's more to it than that.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
